格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness plugin (dsh-plugin): complete Polymarket superpowers — 31 verified tools across Gamma/CLOB/Data-API/Perps/RFQ/Bridge, embedded knowhow skill, live WebSocket stream. Read-only by default.","id":"gh:1343026382","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-polymarket-knowhow","slug":"fashionmascherine-svg/dsh-polymarket-knowhow","topics":["cordis","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","polymarket","polymarket-api","prediction-markets","trading-bot"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness plugin (dsh-plugin): complete Polymarket superpowers — 31 verified tools across Gam"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ma/CLOB/Data-API/Perps/RFQ/Bridge, embedded knowhow skill, live WebSocket stream. Read-only by defau"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"CLOB/Data-API/Perps/RFQ/Bridge, embedded knowhow skill, live WebSocket stream. Read-only by default."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-polymarket-knowhow"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**A DeepSeek Harness plugin that gives your agent complete, verified Polymarket superpowers**: live "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"market-data tools across every Polymarket API (Gamma, CLOB, Data API, Perps, Combos/RFQ, Bridge), op"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"t-in authenticated trading tools, a WebSocket market-stream service, and a bundled *knowhow* skill d"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"istilled from the official docs — so the model never hallucinates endpoints, parameters or auth flow"},{"id":"p3s5","text":"tilled from the official docs — so the model never hallucinates endpoints, parameters or auth flows."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Built on the knowledge base of `atompilot/polymarket-skill` (MIT) and re-verified against the curren"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"t official OpenAPI specs **and live API responses**."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Why this plugin"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"| | This plugin | Raw docs / MCP servers |"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| Works offline for knowhow (bundled skill + `polymarket_knowledge` tool) | ✅ | ❌ |\n| Live tools wit"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"h typed schemas and bounded output | ✅ | partial |\n| Covers auth flow end-to-end (L1 EIP-712 → L2 HM"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"AC → builder headers) | ✅ | partial |\n| New 2026 surfaces: **Perps** (56 ops) and **Combos/RFQ** | ✅"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" documented + read tools | scattered |\n| Endpoint drift corrected (`volume24hr` sorts, flat batch pa"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"yloads, geoblock host, contract moves) | ✅ live-verified | ❌ |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Capabilities"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Four independent Cordis rows (disable any of them by id in a later patch layer):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Row id | Provides |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| `polymarket-service` | `ctx.polymarket` service: one configured client per Polymarket API (Gamma, "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"CLOB, Data, Perps, RFQ, Bridge, Relayer) with timeout/retry/geoblock-aware HTTP |\n| `polymarket-tool"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"s` | ~25 always-on market-data tools + opt-in account/trading tools + Perps tools + `polymarket_know"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"ledge` |\n| `polymarket-skills` | Embedded runtime skill `polymarket` (16 knowledge modules as resour"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"ces) via `ctx.skills` |\n| `polymarket-stream` | Optional market-channel WebSocket bridge emitting `p"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"olymarket/market-event` Cordis events |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Model tools (always registered)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- Discovery: `polymarket_search`, `polymarket_events_list` (offset + keyset pagination), `polymarket"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"_event_get`, `polymarket_markets_list`, `polymarket_market_get`, `polymarket_tags_list`\n- CLOB data:"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" `polymarket_orderbook` (single/batch), `polymarket_price` (single/batch), `polymarket_quote` (mid+s"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"pread+last in one call), `polymarket_price_history`, `polymarket_token_info` (tick size, neg-risk, t"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"oken→market resolution)\n- Data API v2: `polymarket_positions` (status lifecycle + cursor pagination)"},{"id":"p13s6","text":", `polymarket_trades_public`, `polymarket_activity`, `polymarket_holders`, `polymarket_leaderboard`,"},{"id":"p13s7","text":" `polymarket_open_interest`, `polymarket_live_volume`, `polymarket_portfolio_value`, `polymarket_use"},{"id":"p13s8","text":"r_stats`, `polymarket_resolutions`, `polymarket_approvals`\n- Meta: `polymarket_geoblock_check`, `pol"},{"id":"p13s9","text":"ymarket_combo_markets`, `polymarket_knowledge`"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Opt-in tools (registered only when configured)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- `trading.enabled` + L2 credentials → `polymarket_account_orders`, `polymarket_account_trades`, `po"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"lymarket_cancel_orders`, `polymarket_balance_allowance`, `polymarket_heartbeat`, `polymarket_api_key"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"s`, `polymarket_place_order`*\n- `perps.enabled` + perps credentials → `polymarket_perps_market_data`"},{"id":"p15s4","text":", `polymarket_perps_account`"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"\\* Order placement signs through the official unified `@polymarket/client` SDK when it is resolvable"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" (see Trading setup) — it supports both V1 CTF token ids and Protocol V2 position ids. Everything el"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"se uses zero-dependency Node crypto."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The package ships a self-contained `prepare` build. A git install fetches sources, so pnpm ≥10 asks "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"you to allow the build once — copy the package key pnpm prints into your profile's `pnpm-workspace.y"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"o allow the build once — copy the package key pnpm prints into your profile's `pnpm-workspace.yaml`:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Then boot: `dsh --profile my-profile`. All four rows activate; only safe read-only tools are visible"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" unless you enable trading/perps."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Use in Claude Code"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"The same repository is also a Claude Code plugin. It bundles:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"- the **`polymarket` skill** — the 15 knowledge modules under `skills/polymarket/references/` (gener"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ated from `knowledge/`, single source of truth);\n- a **read-only MCP server** (`scripts/mcp-server.m"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"js`) exposing the live market-data tools (search, events, orderbook, prices, quote, price history, p"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"ositions, trades, leaderboard, open interest, perps market data, …). Trading/account tools are never"},{"id":"p24s5","text":" exposed — the server is built with credentials resolution disabled and a denylist guard on top."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Install from this repo's bundled marketplace:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Or attach just the MCP server to any MCP client:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The prebuilt `lib/` is committed, so both paths work out of the box; after touching `src/` run `npm "},{"id":"p29s2","text":"run build` and commit the rebuilt `lib/`. After editing `knowledge/*.md` regenerate the skill copies"},{"id":"p29s3","text":" with `npm run sync:claude-skill`."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Defaults are sensible (public endpoints, no credentials, trading off). Override any field from your "},{"id":"p31s2","text":"profile's `cordis.patch.yml`:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"### Trading setup"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"1. Create L2 API credentials once (any method):\n- `polymarket-client` (Python): `AsyncSecureClient.c"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"reate(private_key=pk).credentials`, or\n- install `@polymarket/client` into the profile and read `cli"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"ent.credentials` after `createSecureClient`.\n2. Put the four values in config or `POLY_*` environmen"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"t variables.\n3. For order placement, also make the unified SDK resolvable and set `POLY_PRIVATE_KEY`"},{"id":"p34s5","text":" variables.\n3. For order placement, also make the unified SDK resolvable and set `POLY_PRIVATE_KEY`:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"Read-only account tools (orders, trades, cancels, balances, heartbeat) work without the SDK — they s"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ign requests with Node's built-in HMAC (L2 headers `POLY_ADDRESS/SIGNATURE/TIMESTAMP/API_KEY/PASSPHR"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"quests with Node's built-in HMAC (L2 headers `POLY_ADDRESS/SIGNATURE/TIMESTAMP/API_KEY/PASSPHRASE`)."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
